title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file:new
catalog: GUI command
target: file:new
summary: Create a folder or a file in the folder a panel shows (self / a panel type)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shell (a builtin)

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+n`` → ``file:new self file`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``ctrl+shift+n`` → ``file:new self folder`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
